\f1\fs22 Haloren Smythe was done with serial killing, just as soon as he\'92d squared the ledger with Sarah Jacobson. His sincerity was evidence-based\'97the Scarlet Shower Surgeon had not struck since his unfinished sport at the wedding of the flabbergastingly delulu Alexander Shakti to Halo\'92s intended love-toy.\
